#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
MDEON Ultra-Lightweight Desktop Settings (Zero-Toolkit Edition)
- Rendering: Pure PyCairo + Native X11 / Wayland backends (Zero GTK/Qt GUI widgets)
- Replicates all GTK4 mdeon-settings tabs: Common, X11, Wayland, Autostart, and Tools
- Includes Live Wallpaper Thumbnail Preview and Cairo Color Picker Dialog
"""

